## Diagraming/Whiteboard

I can create diagram block here, no problem due to Nootropy built-in Mermaid extension using MyST syntax. This edit will sync in the plain-text editor.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  Idea["Idea"]
  Next("Implementing")
  Done["Done"]
  Next --> Done
  Next --> Done
  n1{"Worth Implementing \n via code ?"}
  n1 --> Next
  Idea --> n1
  n2["Note"]
%% nootropy-canvas {"Idea":{"x":9,"y":227},"Next":{"x":203,"y":127},"Done":{"x":324,"y":40},"n1":{"x":141,"y":211},"n2":{"x":452,"y":69,"shape":"sticky"}}
```

